A cross toolchain targeting 64-bit Windows (x86_64-w64-mingw32), for
building Windows PE programs and DLLs such as DXVK and vkd3d-proton.

The compiler, assembler and linker are the installed LLVM (clang, lld,
llvm-ar, llvm-dlltool, llvm-windres). This package adds the mingw-w64
headers, the mingw-w64 CRT targeting the Universal CRT (UCRT),
winpthreads, and LLVM's compiler-rt builtins, libunwind, libc++abi and
libc++ built for the target, the widl IDL compiler, and
x86_64-w64-mingw32-* driver wrappers.
